                                "sense_id": "d7a99118-cb6e-3d14-8375-ac8e8e13dfc4",
                                "text": "Although his existential thoughts seem to have been tossed onto the page in helter-skelter fashion, what Gilboa does here is to open his mind and heart to the reader through verbal jaggedness and poetic unneatness."
                            }
                        ]
